      step: '02',
      title: 'Agree the Accounting Mapping',
      duration: 'Weeks 1 to 2',
      description: 'With your accountant or bookkeeper we agree accounts, tax rates, tracking categories, items, contacts and the rules for credit notes, refunds and voids. This mapping becomes the specification the code is tested against.',
    },
    {
      step: '03',
      title: 'Build Against a Demo File',
      duration: 'Weeks 2 to 5',
